   "act_index": -1
  },
  {
   "id": "v5_006",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "scene": "palace_hall",
   "duration": 6.29,
   "line": "那你们写人物的时候，会不会故意留下疑点？",
   "semantic_visual": "In a palace hall, an old man leans forward, pointing at a half-finished portrait scroll; a historian pauses mid-brush, leaving a deliberate blank space on the silk.",
   "framing": "medium",
   "prompt": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] high-end 3D animated historical Chinese film, ink-black wood, gold leaf, candlelight, volumetric dust. Set in a grand ancient Chinese palace hall with red lacquer columns, silk banners and bronze braziers. Featuring a stylized 3D animated man in his 40s, black hair, wearing a navy suit with gold accents, with watch and mic; a stylized 3D animated man in his 40s, scholar bun black hair, wearing a amber robe with red-brown accents, with brush and scroll. The shot shows the idea through visible action: In a palace hall, an old man leans forward, pointing at a half-finished portrait scroll; a historian pauses mid-brush, leaving a deliberate blank space on the silk.. Framing: medium shot, characters seen naturally, mouth not emphasized. Camera: slow dolly move through the space. Rich physical materials, volumetric light, shallow depth of field, 3D animated feature film quality. no text, no subtitles, no captions, no watermark, no logo, no UI, no distorted faces, no deformed hands, no extra people, no plastic toy look.\n\noverall_soundscape: quiet hall room tone, a distant bronze bell. No dialogue, no human voices, no music.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
   "act_index": -1
  },
  {
   "id": "v5_007",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "scene": "temple_court",
   "duration": 5.01,
   "line": "会。史书写不满的地方，正是后人反复读的地方。",
   "semantic_visual": "A historian sets down his brush beside a scroll with an unfinished margin; in the temple courtyard, empty space glows faintly, inviting unseen readers to lean closer.",
   "framing": "close",
